  "prefLabel": "Site 102.27 Migration corridors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.27 “Migration corridors” means routes travelled by fish or wildlife when travelling between seasonal habitats that are necessary to maintain sustainable fish and wildlife populations.\n\nSource. #10993, eff 12-16-15",
